+      "messageTranslations": {
+        "de": "Welcome to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret. Play as Fret and search for answers to the questions that haunt the Heights' halls. Evade terrifying creatures, solve puzzles, and piece together fractured memories to uncover the truth.<br><br>Don’t Fret, a psychological mascot horror game from Scary Kid Studios, arrives on December 8th. Watch the trailer and see if you can survive the crescendo.<br><br>As a bonus, Don’t Fret is co-published by Miss Behaviour and will include exclusive rewards in Dead by Daylight. Stay tuned for more details.",
+        "en": "Welcome to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret. Play as Fret and search for answers to the questions that haunt the Heights' halls. Evade terrifying creatures, solve puzzles, and piece together fractured memories to uncover the truth.<br><br>Don’t Fret, a psychological mascot horror game from Scary Kid Studios, arrives on December 8th. Watch the trailer and see if you can survive the crescendo.<br><br>As a bonus, Don’t Fret is co-published by Miss Behaviour and will include exclusive rewards in Dead by Daylight. Stay tuned for more details.",
+        "es": "Welcome to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret. Play as Fret and search for answers to the questions that haunt the Heights' halls. Evade terrifying creatures, solve puzzles, and piece together fractured memories to uncover the truth.<br><br>Don’t Fret, a psychological mascot horror game from Scary Kid Studios, arrives on December 8th. Watch the trailer and see if you can survive the crescendo.<br><br>As a bonus, Don’t Fret is co-published by Miss Behaviour and will include exclusive rewards in Dead by Daylight. Stay tuned for more details.",
+        "es-MX": "Welcome to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret. Play as Fret and search for answers to the questions that haunt the Heights' halls. Evade terrifying creatures, solve puzzles, and piece together fractured memories to uncover the truth.<br><br>Don’t Fret, a psychological mascot horror game from Scary Kid Studios, arrives on December 8th. Watch the trailer and see if you can survive the crescendo.<br><br>As a bonus, Don’t Fret is co-published by Miss Behaviour and will include exclusive rewards in Dead by Daylight. Stay tuned for more details.",
+        "fr": "Bienvenue à Harmonic Heights, une école de musique qui dissimule un sombre secret. Incarnez Fret et cherchez les réponses aux questions qui hantent les couloirs de Harmonic Heights. Échappez à de terrifiantes créatures, résolvez des énigmes et rassemblez des souvenirs morcelés pour découvrir.<br><br>Don’t Fret, un jeu d'horreur de mascotte psychologique développé par Scary Kid Studios, arrive le 8 décembre. Regardez la bande-annonce et voyez si vous pouvez survivre au crescendo.<br><br>En bonus, Don’t Fret est coédité par Miss Behaviour et comprendra des récompenses exclusives dans Dead by Daylight. Restez à l'écoute pour plus de détails.",
+        "it": "Welcome to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret. Play as Fret and search for answers to the questions that haunt the Heights' halls. Evade terrifying creatures, solve puzzles, and piece together fractured memories to uncover the truth.<br><br>Don’t Fret, a psychological mascot horror game from Scary Kid Studios, arrives on December 8th. Watch the trailer and see if you can survive the crescendo.<br><br>As a bonus, Don’t Fret is co-published by Miss Behaviour and will include exclusive rewards in Dead by Daylight. Stay tuned for more details.",
+        "ja": "暗い秘密が隠された音楽学校、ハーモニック・ハイツへようこそ。プレイヤーはFretとなり、ハイツの廊下に憑りついた質問に答えます。恐ろしいクリーチャーから逃れ、パズルを解きながら、記憶を紐解き、真実を暴きましょう。<br><br>Scary Kid Studiosが贈るサイコロジカル・マスコットホラーゲーム『Don’t Fret』が12月8日に発売されます。ゲームのトレーラーを今すぐ視聴して、クレッシェンドのサバイバルを体験しましょう。<br><br>Miss Behaviourが共同パブリッシャーの『Don’t Fret』では、『Dead by Daylight』の限定ゲーム内報酬がもらえます。さらなる情報をお見逃しなく！",
+        "ko": "Welcome to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret. Play as Fret and search for answers to the questions that haunt the Heights' halls. Evade terrifying creatures, solve puzzles, and piece together fractured memories to uncover the truth.<br><br>Don’t Fret, a psychological mascot horror game from Scary Kid Studios, arrives on December 8th. Watch the trailer and see if you can survive the crescendo.<br><br>As a bonus, Don’t Fret is co-published by Miss Behaviour and will include exclusive rewards in Dead by Daylight. Stay tuned for more details.",
+        "pl": "Welcome to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret. Play as Fret and search for answers to the questions that haunt the Heights' halls. Evade terrifying creatures, solve puzzles, and piece together fractured memories to uncover the truth.<br><br>Don’t Fret, a psychological mascot horror game from Scary Kid Studios, arrives on December 8th. Watch the trailer and see if you can survive the crescendo.<br><br>As a bonus, Don’t Fret is co-published by Miss Behaviour and will include exclusive rewards in Dead by Daylight. Stay tuned for more details.",
+        "pt-BR": "Welcome to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret. Play as Fret and search for answers to the questions that haunt the Heights' halls. Evade terrifying creatures, solve puzzles, and piece together fractured memories to uncover the truth.<br><br>Don’t Fret, a psychological mascot horror game from Scary Kid Studios, arrives on December 8th. Watch the trailer and see if you can survive the crescendo.<br><br>As a bonus, Don’t Fret is co-published by Miss Behaviour and will include exclusive rewards in Dead by Daylight. Stay tuned for more details.",
+        "ru": "Welcome to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret. Play as Fret and search for answers to the questions that haunt the Heights' halls. Evade terrifying creatures, solve puzzles, and piece together fractured memories to uncover the truth.<br><br>Don’t Fret, a psychological mascot horror game from Scary Kid Studios, arrives on December 8th. Watch the trailer and see if you can survive the crescendo.<br><br>As a bonus, Don’t Fret is co-published by Miss Behaviour and will include exclusive rewards in Dead by Daylight. Stay tuned for more details.",
+        "th": "Welcome to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret. Play as Fret and search for answers to the questions that haunt the Heights' halls. Evade terrifying creatures, solve puzzles, and piece together fractured memories to uncover the truth.<br><br>Don’t Fret, a psychological mascot horror game from Scary Kid Studios, arrives on December 8th. Watch the trailer and see if you can survive the crescendo.<br><br>As a bonus, Don’t Fret is co-published by Miss Behaviour and will include exclusive rewards in Dead by Daylight. Stay tuned for more details.",
+        "tr": "Welcome to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret. Play as Fret and search for answers to the questions that haunt the Heights' halls. Evade terrifying creatures, solve puzzles, and piece together fractured memories to uncover the truth.<br><br>Don’t Fret, a psychological mascot horror game from Scary Kid Studios, arrives on December 8th. Watch the trailer and see if you can survive the crescendo.<br><br>As a bonus, Don’t Fret is co-published by Miss Behaviour and will include exclusive rewards in Dead by Daylight. Stay tuned for more details.",
+        "zh-Hans": "欢迎来到“和声高地”——这是一所隐藏着黑暗秘密的音乐学校。你将扮演Fret，在校园中探寻困扰着这里的种种谜团。你需要躲避恐怖生物，解开各类谜题，并拼凑起支离破碎的记忆，从而揭开真相。<br><br>由 Scary Kid Studios 开发的吉祥物心理恐怖游戏《勿惧弦外》将于 12 月 8 日登陆 PS5、Xbox 和 PC 平台。观看预告片，看看你是否能在高潮迭起的恐怖中幸存下来。<br><br>此外，《勿惧弦外》由 Miss Behaviour 联合发行，将在《黎明杀机》中提供独家奖励。敬请关注。",
+        "zh-Hant": "Welcome to Harmonic Heights, a music school hiding a dark secret. Play as Fret and search for answers to the questions that haunt the Heights' halls. Evade terrifying creatures, solve puzzles, and piece together fractured memories to uncover the truth.<br><br>Don’t Fret, a psychological mascot horror game from Scary Kid Studios, arrives on December 8th. Watch the trailer and see if you can survive the crescendo.<br><br>As a bonus, Don’t Fret is co-published by Miss Behaviour and will include exclusive rewards in Dead by Daylight. Stay tuned for more details."
